    "description": "M70-AR Buffer Extension Adaptor: Laffs Dynamics\n\nA single part mount for the Zastava M70 AK, designed for the adapted usage of AR-15/M4 buffer extensions to attach \ncompatible buttstocks. \n\nTwo variants are available:\n\n *Standard Height\n *+4mm Height\n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 220C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .20mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 7+\nInfill: 25%+\nMaterial Flow: 100%\nSupport Material Percentage: 16%\n\n\n\nHardware Needed:\n\n1x M8x30 Bolt, 1mm fine thread pitch (NOT 1.25mm)\n\n1x M8 Washer, 15mm OD (Optional)\n\n2x M4x8mm Set Screw\n\n\n\nAccreditations:\n\nProSpaceDog/Space Dog Industries: Provided model dimensions of buffer extension threads and failure point data on their original \ndesign. ",
